DESCRIPTION:THE IMPORTANCE OF WEARING YOUR HAT BACKWARDS: Featuring Bryan Robison\n\nAgency Solutions LIVE | Monday, August 17, 2026 | 4:00 PM Eastern\n\nBryan joins Agency Solutions LIVE for a practical\, live session on The Importance of Wearing Your Hat Backwards - the kind of call you leave with something you can use the same week.\n\nWe'll get into Why I am not wearing my hat backwards in this photo?\, Best kinds of hats to buy\, How many hats is to many hats?\, and Favorite colors - plus a live Q&A at the end.\n\nFree to attend and live on Zoom. Bring your questions for Bryan.\n\nJoin via Zoom:\nhttps://us06web.zoom.us/j/83265414523?pwd=Sgk6RfpMJpYwZbNryS0lqqUysWNFui.1\n\nMeeting ID: 832 6541 4523\nPasscode: Not required\n\nConnecting Agents - Inspiring Greatness\nAgency Network
